{
  "id": "bodyweight-basics",
  "name": "Bodyweight Basics",
  "description": "Two short full-body workouts a week for 6 weeks for someone starting from nothing or coming back after a long break, with nothing but floor space and a wall. No jumping and no burpees: a squat or bridge, a push, a back exercise, a lunge and core work each day, two sets at first and three later. When every set reaches the top of its range, move on to the No Equipment program. The optional exercises add calves and an easy back stretch.",
